  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mawazo Institute is a women-led African organization supporting early-career women researchers to find local solutions to global development challenges by empowering women who are significantly underrepresented in academia and research. This grant will enable Mawazo to develop a policy engagement program to advance African women researchers&#x2019; meaningful and impactful engagement with the national, regional, and global policy space. (Strategy: Evidence-Informed Policymaking)</narrative>
  </description>
